# GitHub CODEOWNERS uses last-match-wins: the LAST pattern in this file that
# matches a path decides its owner(s). Keep broad directory rules above the
# narrower rules nested inside them within each section, and never add a
# trailing catch-all (`* @someone`) below these without re-checking that it
# does not blank out a narrower rule above it (tests/test_codeowners.py
# checks this invariant for the patterns below).
